OL,3,AWayne Rooney leads I'm A Celebrity...
OL,4,AGet Me Out of Here! line-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer England and Manchester United
OL,7,Ffootballer Wayne Rooney, Gavin and
OL,8,FStacey star Joanna Page and YouTuber
OL,9,FSharky will be among the intrepid crew
OL,10,Fentering the jungle Down Under for this
OL,11,Fyear's I'm A Celebrity... Get Me Out Of
OL,12,FHere!
OL,14,FThey will be joined by Kaiser Chiefs
OL,15,Ffrontman Ricky Wilson, Paralympian and
OL,16,Fpresenter Ade Adepitan, actress Claire
OL,17,FSweeney and broadcaster Mariella
OL,18,FFrostrup.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
